Foley and ambience: synthesised in code (core/audio/sfx.py and mix.py), no recordings.

Code:
  engine/silk.js is adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library's silkscreen-poster demo
  (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Lemomo (LemoLab).
  The render, audio and check tools under $LIB/core are from the same library (MIT).

Flag geometry: the standard 1:2 construction of the State Flag of the Republic of Uzbekistan
(stripes 80/5/80/5/80, crescent and 12 stars), redrawn as paths in engine/poster.js.

No voice, no stock footage, no generated images: every frame is drawn in code.
The score is original; it does not quote the state anthem.
